---
import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section class="relative w-full bg-[#33291F] text-white py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-20 select-none overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="reach-heading">
  <div class="max-w-[1260px] mx-auto min-h-[480px] flex flex-col justify-between">
    <!-- Top Left: "Vždy na dosah" -->
    <div class="text-left mb-16 sm:mb-24">
      <h2 id="reach-heading" class="font-sans font-bold text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-[104px] tracking-[-0.05em] text-white leading-[0.88]">
        Vždy<br />
        na dosah
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom: Flex container with Right-aligned Subtitle & Pill Button -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-end justify-between gap-6 pt-12">
      <div></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:items-end text-left sm:text-right max-w-[420px]">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-white/90 leading-[1.5] mb-6 font-normal">
          Drží samo na magnet, v kapse i pod pultem. Jediným stiskem aktivujete sirénu i SMS poplach.
        </p>

        <a
          href="#kontakt"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-[#2B2523] bg-white hover:bg-white/90 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Objednat sadu</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
